*.png
# Visual regression baselines must be committed — they ARE the source of
# truth that CI diffs against. Override the broad *.png rule above.
!apps/docs/e2e/visual.spec.ts-snapshots/*.png
# Same reasoning for the React Native screenshots: the docs site cannot render
# a React Native component, so `/native/<slug>` serves a committed screenshot
# pair, and those PNGs double as the visual baseline. Without this negation
# `pnpm run native:screens` reports success and stages nothing, and every
# native docs page ships two broken images.
!apps/docs/public/native/*.png

# Local UI reference material — structural inspiration only, not part of the
# project source. Re-authored blocks live in packages/components; these
# exemplars must not be committed.
references/

# Temporary feature POCs generated by `hex poc` — not part of the repo
crm-poc*/

# Expo (native playground)
.expo/
.expo-export/
